    "title": "Changes to childcare regulations might be coming soon to Anchorage municipal code - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Allgood ,\n23 hours ago ANCHORAGE, Alaska (KTUU) - The Anchorage Health Department is proposing an update to childcare regulations in Anchorage, hoping to decrease the regulatory burden on providers, and increase childcare availability. The Anchorage Assembly took up the topic at its meeting on Tuesday and continued public hearing to June 23. Anchorage Health... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
